---
---
<section class="bg-black py-28 px-6 text-center">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-5">The Sunday Ritual</span>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Read Sunday. Move Monday.</h2>
    <p class="text-white/55 text-lg font-light mb-16">Your head is calm. The week hasn't started. No noise, no pressure just the signal you need.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row border border-[#FFD100]/15 mb-16">
      <div class="flex-1 py-10 px-6 md:border-r border-[#FFD100]/15">
        <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-3">Sunday Morning</div>
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Read</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-white/40 mt-2">Edition lands in your inbox</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1 py-10 px-6 md:border-r border-[#FFD100]/15 border-t md:border-t-0">
        <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-3">Sunday Evening</div>
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Decide</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-white/40 mt-2">Process. Consider. Choose your move.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1 py-10 px-6 border-t md:border-t-0">
        <div class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-3">Monday Morning</div>
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Execute</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-white/40 mt-2">Markets open. You're already ready.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-light italic text-white/70 max-w-xl mx-auto">
      "By the time your inbox fills up on Monday morning, your financial move for the week is already done."
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<hr class="border-none h-px bg-[#FFD100]/15" />
